      <activity id="fe732c40-e20f-57d1-ac49-8087c4d733da" activityNameId="af1283c6-ad17-5fdb-a5b5-ddc8151be1cb" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Photovoltaic panel, mc-Si, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Photovoltaic panel, mc-Si, at plant
Production of solar panels with 72 solar cells a 125*125cm2 with a capacity of 185Wp. Production of 18000 panels per year.;
Synonyms: PV-module; 
UUID: 31098d8a-5b32-3767-9c86-ea8e5f7942f4
Production of the cell matrix, cutting of foils and washing of glass, production of laminate, isolation. Aluminium frame of the panel.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Modern production plant.
Time period: Date of publication.
Production volume: Worldwide module production in 2000, 238MW (60%pc-Si, 40% mc-Si). Europe 23MW.
Sampling: Environmental reports and publication of plant data. 
Extrapolations: Number of cells 112.5 because of smaller size of cells.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_31098d8a-5b32-3767-9c86-ea8e5f7942f4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
